-(`lakelet/4.18-cardinality-cost`), and summation (`lakelet/4.12-aggregation-correctness`). -->
+- **`OR`, and what it costs to prune one.** `lakelet/4.14-index-pruning` is where a disjunction is
+  argued rather than declined, and where the plan grows a second pruning decision
+  (`blocks_pruned`) on the same surface this page describes.
+- **a series index.** Whether a store has *ever* held a metric is decided today from the segments a
+  range touches, because the manifest names records and spans and not series — so a range with no
+  segment in it is answered empty whatever `FROM` names. A store that knows its own names cheaply is
+  `lakelet/4.18-cardinality-cost`.
+- **summation, and the numbers a query is wrong about.** Every value on this page is computed by
+  `lakelet/4.10-downsampling`'s pass, and what a running sum costs is
+  `lakelet/4.12-aggregation-correctness`.
